N1  - Analytic subject: Intervention effectiveness and implementation context. Patient sex/gender: Sex adjustment only; no sex-stratified intervention effect or intervention-by-sex test in main text or reviewed supplement tables.. Physician sex/gender: No physician-gender effect tested. Comparison: Intervention/implementation versus comparator; not female-versus-male treatment effect. Inference boundary: No reported intervention-by-patient-sex/gender test in the reviewed material; no demonstrated closure of a women/men equity gap..
